WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.240
This film is about food.

2
00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.720
My favourite food is cheese.

3
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.800
There are hundreds of different types of cheeses,

4
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.760
and I think I’ve had most of them.

5
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.720
What are your favourite types of food?

6
00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:22.200
I like pasta meals,

7
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.400
like lasagne and spaghetti bolognese.

8
00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.280
I like unhealthy foods,

9
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.560
like burgers, chips and ketchup.

10
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.000
I like sandwiches,

11
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
like chicken mayonnaise and salad.

12
00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:34.440
And what is the most unusual thing

13
00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:35.440
you’ve ever tried?

14
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.520
Last year, I tried curry,

15
00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.560
but I didn’t like it because it was too spicy.

16
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.680
When I went to France, I ate snails.

17
00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:44.000
They were horrible.

18
00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.400
When I was on holiday,

19
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.200
my dad made me try mussels,

20
00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.320
but they were disgusting.

21
00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.000
And do you think it’s good to try

22
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.760
different types of food and drink?

23
00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.560
Yes, when I go on holiday,

24
00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:55.160
I like to try the local foods.

25
00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:56.440
I think it’s good,

26
00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:57.680
so then you can find out

27
00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:58.960
what you like and what you don’t like.

28
00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.480
My mum thinks so, but I disagree.
